msgid "Block by address"
msgstr "Blokeeri aadressi järgi"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1213
msgid "Scripts in page HTML are matched only while Custom Code blocking is on."
msgstr ""
"Lehe HTML-is olevaid skripte võrreldakse ainult siis, kui Kohandatud koodi "
"blokeerimine on sees."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1259 includes/class-admin.php:1289
