msgstr "Aadress sisaldab"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1274
msgid "Add address"
msgstr "Lisa aadress"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1284
msgid "Necessary (never blocked)"
msgstr "Vajalikud (ei blokeerita kunagi)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:889
msgid "Reviews widgets"
msgstr "Arvustuste vidinad"

#: includes/class-admin.php:889
msgid "The Trustmary reviews widget waits for analytics consent, because it stores a visitor ID in the browser. A message with an accept button is shown in its place. To load it right away, add widget.trustmary.com under Block by address with the category “Necessary (never blocked)”."
msgstr ""
"Trustmary arvustuste vidin ootab analüütika nõusolekut, sest see salvestab "
"brauserisse külastaja ID. Selle asemel kuvatakse teade nõustumisnupuga. "
"Vidina kohe laadimiseks lisage widget.trustmary.com jaotisesse Blokeeri "
"aadressi järgi kategooriaga „Vajalikud (ei blokeerita kunagi)“."

#: includes/class-admin.php:890
msgid "Blocks any other script by part of its address until the visitor accepts the category you choose, for example a widget the plugin does not recognize. Turn on Show message for scripts that show content on the page."
msgstr ""
"Blokeerib mis tahes muu skripti selle aadressi osa järgi, kuni külastaja "
"nõustub teie valitud kategooriaga – näiteks vidina, mida plugin ei tunne. "
"Lülitage sisse Näita teadet nende skriptide puhul, mis kuvavad lehel sisu."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:137
msgctxt "cookie duration"
msgid "Persistent"
msgstr "Püsiv"

#: includes/class-scanner.php:209
msgid "Trustmary: stores a visitor ID, the landing page and conversions in the browser’s local storage."
msgstr ""
"Trustmary: salvestab brauseri kohalikku salvestusruumi külastaja ID, "
"sihtlehe ja konversioonid."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:224
msgid "Reddit Pixel: identifies the browser for ad measurement."
msgstr "Reddit Pixel: tuvastab brauseri reklaamide mõõtmiseks."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:225
msgid ""
"Microsoft Advertising: groups page views into a session for ad measurement."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Advertising: koondab lehevaatamised reklaamide mõõtmiseks üheks "
"seansiks."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:226
msgid ""
"Microsoft Advertising: identifies the visitor across visits for ad "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Advertising: tuvastab külastaja eri külastuste vältel reklaamide "
"mõõtmiseks."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:227
msgid "Criteo: stores a browser identifier for ad personalisation."
msgstr ""
"Criteo: salvestab brauseri identifikaatori reklaamide isikupärastamiseks."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:228
msgid "Taboola: identifies the browser for ad targeting."
msgstr "Taboola: tuvastab brauseri reklaamide sihtimiseks."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:229
msgid "Klaviyo: recognises returning visitors for email marketing."
msgstr "Klaviyo: tunneb ära korduvkülastajad e-posti turunduse jaoks."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:230
msgid "Yandex Metrica: identifies visitors and stores session settings."
msgstr "Yandex Metrica: tuvastab külastajad ja salvestab seansi seaded."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:231
msgid "Segment: stores an anonymous visitor ID and traits."
msgstr "Segment: salvestab anonüümse külastaja ID ja omadused."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:232
msgid "Intercom: keeps the chat messenger session and visitor identity."
msgstr "Intercom: hoiab alles vestlusakna seansi ja külastaja identiteedi."

#: includes/class-scanner.php:233
msgid "Crisp: keeps the chat session and visitor identity."
msgstr "Crisp: hoiab alles vestlusseansi ja külastaja identiteedi."

